                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f073a850-b11c-358d-9cde-477252babb44",
                        "entry_id": "5640e015-478a-3488-8f44-be1c0f483f95",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To dawdle aimlessly, to idle time away."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe54e23b-a326-4fa4-8fb3-d3519cab46f3",
                                "sense_id": "f073a850-b11c-358d-9cde-477252babb44",
                                "text": "Over a sonata by Schubert he — well, I suppose I must not say that he moodled, or maundered, or anything of that sort."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe76e2c2-24f0-46df-aa05-45d68e70fcd5",
                                "sense_id": "f073a850-b11c-358d-9cde-477252babb44",
                                "text": "The Poet moodles (from Brenda Ueland's If You Want to Write). She fools around, meanders, and takes time for feelings and not just ideas."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab45ef0e-19bb-45b6-860d-afc597b0bc01",
                                "sense_id": "f073a850-b11c-358d-9cde-477252babb44",
                                "text": "I cannot begin to count the number of times I have moodled, set a sermon aside, often in midstream, and taken a walk through the church gardens, or around the city block, even caught a brief nap on the study sofa; in other words, I have let my mind lie fallow, and then returned to the task with inspiration renewed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1f29a7e-b475-475c-bf8f-cff5951d52b9",
                                "sense_id": "f073a850-b11c-358d-9cde-477252babb44",
                                "text": "She moodled all day and all night. Hundreds of tiny notions streamed from her head and ideas bounced back and forth, but no real possibilities formed."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
